# {{ project_name }}

Multi-tenant Django project built on [tripaulx-sdk](https://github.com/tripaulx/tripaulx-builder-init).
Each workspace has its own PostgreSQL schema and is served at
`<slug>.{{ base_domain }}`.

## Run locally

Requirements: [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and PostgreSQL 16 (Homebrew).

```bash
./start          # creates .env.local and the database, migrates, asks for the
                 # first workspace's owner (in a terminal), runs :8000
./start admin    # another administrator (name, e-mail, password twice)
./start test     # test-suite
```

- Public schema: http://{{ local_base_domain }}:8000/admin/
- First workspace: http://{{ initial_workspace | replace('_', '-') }}.{{ local_base_domain }}:8000/admin/

API (tripaulx-sdk accounts):

- `POST /api/auth/signup/` on the apex domain creates a workspace and its owner.
- `/api/auth/...` on each workspace: login with mandatory 2FA, TOTP, passkeys,
  recovery codes, password reset; `/api/workspace/...`: members and invitations.
- `/api/legal/public/...` (apex and workspaces): terms of use and privacy
  policy; `/api/v1/legal/...` (workspace admins): governance documents.
  Before going live, edit `legal/` and run `manage.py legal_check`.
- OpenAPI docs for admins: http://{{ local_base_domain }}:8000/api/docs/
  (on workspaces only while `DEBUG` is on).

Create an admin inside a workspace:

```bash
./start admin                     # first workspace ({{ initial_workspace }})
./start admin --schema <slug> --role admin
```

## Deploy (CapRover)

```bash
cp .env.deploy.example .env.deploy   # CapRover App Tokens (never committed)
./deploy prod all                    # checks, then web and worker
```

Setup of the four CapRover apps, the variables and the wildcard subdomains:
[docs/deployment.md](docs/deployment.md).

## Layout

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `config/settings/base_parts/` | settings chunks (never edit `base.py`) |
| `config/settings/{local,prod,test}.py` | per-environment settings |
| `config/urls.py` / `urls_public.py` | workspace / public-schema routes |
| `users/` | concrete `User` (inherits `AbstractTripaulxUser`) |
| `legal/` | project legal documents, overriding the SDK templates |

## Update from the template

```bash
uvx copier update --trust
```
